                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Purplle's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Tier-2/3 India focus + accessible-mass positioning + Faces Canada acquisition + marketplace + own-brand hybrid. Multi-dimensional accessible beauty advantage.</p>
                                        <h3>Purplle vs Nykaa?</h3>
                                        <p>Complementary. Nykaa premium urban. Purplle accessible mass tier-2/3. Different geographic + psychographic + price segments.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new tier-2/3 focused D2C brands compete?</h3>
